【Auto】 Use Default Value
The default values are suitable for most scenarios. Do not change if unnecessary.
【说明】使用默认值
默认值适用于大多数情况，请勿轻易更改。

【Tab: Scope】
Android 15+ (SDK 35) launchers run in a "T" (top-level) process, which
Xposed modules cannot hook. This module works on Android 16 (SDK 36)
and older. [SCOPE] Only requires the Pixel Launcher process.

【作用域】
Android 15+（SDK 35）的启动器以“T”进程运行，Xposed 无法注入；
本模块适用于 Android 16（SDK 36）及以下。【作用域】仅需勾选 Pixel 启动器进程。

【Tab: Launch】
No configuration needed. Open the launcher's drawer after changing
its desktop icon shape. [LAUNCH] No app to launch.
【启动】无需配置。修改桌面图标形状后打开抽屉即可。
